Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:32:24 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,280] | Words: 25 | Text: 你有没有发现那些鞋子楼里干干净净敲键盘的人往往都在还花呗
Segment #2   [00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:08,380] | Words: 21 | Text: 反倒是那些满腿泥满嘴跑火车天天处理烂摊子的人
Segment #3   [00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,660] | Words: 5  | Text: 瞧瞧复起来了
Segment #4   [00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:10,620] | Words: 4  | Text: 这不是讽刺
Segment #5   [00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,460] | Words: 10 | Text: 这是你穷的太干净的代价
Segment #6   [00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,660] | Words: 9  | Text: 很多年轻人从小被教育
Segment #7   [00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,920] | Words: 10 | Text: 做人要老实做事要干净
Segment #8   [00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,080] | Words: 5  | Text: 赚钱要体面
Segment #9   [00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,660] | Words: 15 | Text: 长大后你会发现一个颠覆三官的真相
Segment #10  [00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:23,240] | Words: 12 | Text: 太干净的思维根本赚不到大钱
Segment #11  [00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,140] | Words: 4  | Text: 这里的干净
Segment #12  [00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,460] | Words: 7  | Text: 不是让你违法乱净
Segment #13  [00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,820] | Words: 7  | Text: 不是让你投机取巧
Segment #14  [00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,860] | Words: 11 | Text: 而是很多年轻人的思维结屁
Segment #15  [00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,860] | Words: 4  | Text: 任之结屁
Segment #16  [00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,080] | Words: 5  | Text: 你排斥麻烦
Segment #17  [00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,060] | Words: 4  | Text: 排斥所碎
Segment #18  [00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:32,940] | Words: 4  | Text: 排斥低端
Segment #19  [00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,180] | Words: 4  | Text: 排斥人情
Segment #20  [00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,200] | Words: 4  | Text: 排斥复杂
Segment #21  [00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,620] | Words: 11 | Text: 你总觉得赚钱应该干干净净
Segment #22  [00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,540] | Words: 4  | Text: 轻轻松松
Segment #23  [00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,420] | Words: 4  | Text: 轨轨居居
Segment #24  [00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,400] | Words: 4  | Text: 优雅体面
Segment #25  [00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,700] | Words: 4  | Text: 凡是累的
Segment #26  [00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,420] | Words: 2  | Text: 脏的
Segment #27  [00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,380] | Words: 3  | Text: 反所的
Segment #28  [00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,320] | Words: 4  | Text: 需要周选的
Segment #29  [00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,520] | Words: 4  | Text: 需要落地的
Segment #30  [00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,520] | Words: 5  | Text: 你本能排斥
Segment #31  [00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,420] | Words: 4  | Text: 本能抗拒
Segment #32  [00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,340] | Words: 4  | Text: 本能远离
Segment #33  [00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,100] | Words: 8  | Text: 但现实的底层逻辑
Segment #34  [00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:50,960] | Words: 4  | Text: 极其残酷
Segment #35  [00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:51,480] | Words: 2  | Text: 大钱
Segment #36  [00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,960] | Words: 7  | Text: 从来都藏在复杂
Segment #37  [00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:53,680] | Words: 2  | Text: 所碎
Segment #38  [00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,360] | Words: 2  | Text: 麻烦
Segment #39  [00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,540] | Words: 6  | Text: 别人嫌弃的地方
Segment #40  [00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:56,580] | Words: 2  | Text: 干净
Segment #41  [00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,320] | Words: 2  | Text: 轻松
Segment #42  [00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:58,040] | Words: 2  | Text: 体面
Segment #43  [00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,040] | Words: 4  | Text: 优雅的工作
Segment #44  [00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,480] | Words: 6  | Text: 所有人都抢着做
Segment #45  [00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,920] | Words: 7  | Text: 所有人都盯着内卷
Segment #46  [00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,560] | Words: 7  | Text: 利润被无限贪宝
Segment #47  [00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,700] | Words: 6  | Text: 只能维持温宝
Segment #48  [00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,860] | Words: 6  | Text: 只能勉强生存
Segment #49  [00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:07,400] | Words: 7  | Text: 那些真正有意价
Segment #50  [00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,080] | Words: 3  | Text: 有利润
Segment #51  [00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,180] | Words: 6  | Text: 有红利的领域
Segment #52  [00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,300] | Words: 5  | Text: 一定是麻烦多
Segment #53  [00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,120] | Words: 3  | Text: 所事多
Segment #54  [00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:11,840] | Words: 3  | Text: 落地难
Segment #55  [00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,020] | Words: 5  | Text: 没人愿意干
Segment #56  [00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:14,520] | Words: 8  | Text: 门砍引行高的行业
Segment #57  [00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,060] | Words: 9  | Text: 普通人手着思维结屁
Segment #58  [00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,500] | Words: 7  | Text: 只想做光线亮丽
Segment #59  [00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,220] | Words: 4  | Text: 受人尊重
Segment #60  [00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:19,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 简单轻松的事
Segment #61  [00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,480] | Words: 7  | Text: 最后只能在红海
Segment #62  [00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,720] | Words: 7  | Text: 塞到里内卷私杀
Segment #63  [00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:22,580] | Words: 4  | Text: 耗尽轻春
Segment #64  [00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:24,360] | Words: 7  | Text: 强者早就看透了
Segment #65  [00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,200] | Words: 5  | Text: 赚钱的本质
Segment #66  [00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,260] | Words: 5  | Text: 是解决麻烦
Segment #67  [00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:27,140] | Words: 3  | Text: 成结问题
Segment #68  [00:01:27,140 --> 00:01:28,260] | Words: 4  | Text: 消化所岁
Segment #69  [00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:29,240] | Words: 5  | Text: 别人嫌麻烦
Segment #70  [00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:29,860] | Words: 3  | Text: 你成结
Segment #71  [00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,740] | Words: 4  | Text: 别人嫌辛苦
Segment #72  [00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:31,400] | Words: 3  | Text: 你落地
Segment #73  [00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 别人嫌低断
Segment #74  [00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:32,920] | Words: 3  | Text: 你身更
Segment #75  [00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,120] | Words: 6  | Text: 别人嫌弃的地方
Segment #76  [00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,540] | Words: 7  | Text: 就是你的利润糊成合
Segment #77  [00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:37,360] | Words: 11 | Text: 很多读书人老是人一辈子窮
Segment #78  [00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 不是不努力
Segment #79  [00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,320] | Words: 4  | Text: 不是不聪明
Segment #80  [00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,000] | Words: 3  | Text: 是思维
Segment #81  [00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,600] | Words: 3  | Text: 太单纯
Segment #82  [00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,300] | Words: 3  | Text: 太干净
Segment #83  [00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,200] | Words: 4  | Text: 太理想化
Segment #84  [00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,620] | Words: 8  | Text: 接受不了社会的复杂
Segment #85  [00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:45,500] | Words: 10 | Text: 接受不了赚钱的落地所岁
Segment #86  [00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,060] | Words: 8  | Text: 最后被干净的思维
Segment #87  [00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:48,560] | Words: 8  | Text: 所死了一生的财富
Segment #88  [00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:50,300] | Words: 7  | Text: 真正的认知觉醒
Segment #89  [00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:51,680] | Words: 6  | Text: 放下思维结辟
Segment #90  [00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,880] | Words: 6  | Text: 接纳现实复杂
Segment #91  [00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:54,320] | Words: 7  | Text: 不追求形式干净
Segment #92  [00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,520] | Words: 7  | Text: 只追求结果落地
Segment #93  [00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,860] | Words: 5  | Text: 允许自己落地
Segment #94  [00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:58,080] | Words: 5  | Text: 允许自己所岁
Segment #95  [00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,320] | Words: 5  | Text: 允许自己万妖
Segment #96  [00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:01,080] | Words: 10 | Text: 你才能真正接住普通人
Segment #97  [00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:01,980] | Words: 6  | Text: 接不住的财富
Segment #98  [00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,420] | Words: 6  | Text: 思维太过干净
Segment #99  [00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:04,760] | Words: 6  | Text: 人生注定轻平
Segment #100 [00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,880] | Words: 6  | Text: 接纳世俗复杂
Segment #101 [00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,060] | Words: 6  | Text: 方能承载财富
